  "question": {
    "text": "The coefficient of friction between the rubber tyres and the road wayis $0.25 .$ The maximum speed with which a car can be driven round a curve of radius $20 \\mathrm{~m}$ without skidding is $\\left(\\mathrm{g}=9.8 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}^{2}\\right)$",
